{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22265","headline":"秋蝶 · 白居易","name":"秋蝶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋花紫蒙蒙，秋蝶黄茸茸。\n花低蝶新小，飞戏丛西东。\n日暮凉风来，纷纷花落丛。\n夜深白露冷，蝶已死丛中。\n朝生夕俱死，气类各相从。\n不见千年鹤，多栖百丈松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}